<title>BRAZIL: Globex Utilidades SA Q1 shr down.</title>
<headline>Globex Utilidades SA Q1 shr down.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO, Brazil 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended March 31,</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			 R$0.20		   R$0.41</p>
<p> Net			   12.8		     24.4</p>
<p> Revs			 337.3		    338.7</p>
<p> Avg shrs	    64,365,000	     60,240,000</p>
<p>(All data above in millions of Bravilian Reais, except per share numbers and share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Above data uses Corporate Law accounting method. First quarter net income was R$339 million, or R$0.15 per share, compared with R$375 million, or R$0.33 per share for the year-ago period, when computed using the fully corrected accounting method.</p>
<p>Net income per share in 1996 is adjusted after a split of 1 to 24 shares.</p>
</text>
